        "description": "Retrieve specialized classification instructions for the Router Agent.\n\nUse this tool when you need guidance on one of the following modules:\n- content_classification\n- sentiment_analysis\n- relevance_scoring\n- routing_rules\n- edge_cases\n\nCall only the module relevant to the current classification task. Provide the source and content type as context when available.\n\nThis tool retrieves instructions only. It does not classify content, analyze sentiment, calculate scores, or determine routing decisions.",
